touch the surface before reforming, suturing together the ship's broken body, healing its wounds."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["Logos!"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4133_logos_1#12$1","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4133_logos_1#12$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Logos","text":"Everyone, allow me to handle the shattered fragments."},{"t":"line","name":"Logos","text":"Pass through the shadow. The skeletal nerves that will ferry us back are ready."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"duration":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_magicwrite","volume":0.6,"loop":true,"channel":"logos"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"logos","fadetime":6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The banshee's bone pen hangs down from his hand, lightly touching upon the surface of the shadow."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"With shadow as parchment, the banshee scribes his incantations with restless flicks of his wrist."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Golden veins wend their way through the shadows, as the fires are slowly extinguished."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_grenade_explosion","volume":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":4,"xstrength":40,"ystrength":40,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_explosion","volume":0.7,"loop":false,"channel":"explo","delay":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_explo_n","volume":0.7,"loop":false,"channel":"explo1","delay":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1035_wisdel_1#4$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"W","