sing light."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A gentle light. A graceful light. A light that pacifies all confusion, mayhem and disorder."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The rays wash over the shadow, becoming ever more dazzling."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The purest white erases all color around you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Immediately after, a black hole appears in the distance, devouring the radiance whole."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"50_i14_2","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"bgeffect","a":{"name":"AVG_soul_glow","layer":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/AVG/m_avg_ghosthunter_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/AVG/m_avg_ghosthunter_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":4,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Darkness. Tranquility."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Amidst the pitch-black dark, a singularity emits its first ray of light."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The light of thought. The light of emotion. The light of rebirth."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The ray of weak, reddish light begins to grow and expand."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Illuminating the hand that wrought it."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Illuminating—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"50_i14","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":4,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":4,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"decision","options":["Theresa..."],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"She walks forth from the darkness... No, she has been there all along."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"It is just that for a moment, she chose to let her gaze fall upon you. For only a moment."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Within her embrace, the revenant's scattered consciousness coalesces once more."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"All his sorrow. All his misery. All his rage."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"They dissipate as she consoles him, and at last, the revenant returns to serenity."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"She carries her compatriot, abandoned by death as he is. She brings rebirth. She rewrites fate."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["Theresa!"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"There is no response, but you manage to glean some curious information from her expression."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You dare not say for sure."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Everyone holds their breath because of her presence. Everyone awaits the first words out of her mouth."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Silence."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"She says nothing, retreating back into the gloom."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"bgeffect","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"50_g9_airshipdeck","screenadapt":"coverall","block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"She leaves no tracks. It is like she were never here."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"But everyone understands that she has finally taken action."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1035_wisdel_1#15$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"Did I miss Her Highness say something—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_airshiptakeoff","volume":0,"loop":true,"channel":"air"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"soundvolume","a":{"volume":0.6,"channel":"machine","fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_erthshkng","loop":true,"channel":"sk","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":4,"xstrength":40,"ystrength":40,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"air","fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"sk","fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act27d0d0/m_bat_shatterpoint_01_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act27d0d0/m_bat_shatterpoint_01_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1035_wisdel_1#5$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"Hey, wait, the airship's moving again?! It's even at full speed!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1035_wisdel_1#6$2","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"W","text":"I thought the old fossil was—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#5$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"It is Originium."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"We have gotten too close to Amnannam. The airship is an Originium-rich environment, and its stocks onboard fuel it with energy."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#18$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Theresa...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit","screenadapt":"coverall","block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_erthshkng","volume":1,"loop":true,"channel":"e"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"e","fadetime":4}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":3,"xstrength":40,"ystrength":40,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#5$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ines","text":"The nerve connections snapped?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#5$1","focus":"n"}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Through the openings in the skeleton, she sees that the great witchcraft-powered construct has already broken free of the nerve bindings, now hurtling at unchasable speeds towards Amnannam hanging in the sky."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ines","text":"W...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_clothmovement","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4088_hodrer_1#6$1","duration":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#7$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ines","text":"Hoederer! You're awake?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4088_hodrer_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hoederer","text":"Emergency landing..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#7$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ines","text":"What did you say?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4088_hodrer_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hoederer","text":"The Feranmut... It left a final bit of energy inside the Lifebone."},{"t":"line","name":"Hoederer","text":"Perform an emergency landing... in Londinium, somewhere safe..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#9$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ines","text":"W and the others are still on the airship!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4088_hodrer_1#6$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hoederer","text":"I already... promised Dr. Kal'tsit... and the Doctor."},{"t":"line","name":"Hoederer","text":"To do everything we can... to save more lives."},{"t":"line","name":"Hoederer","text":"All we can do... is try our best..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4087_ines_1#5$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ines","text":"But—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_black","screenadapt":"coverall","block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Many have called you by these titles."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"'The evil spirit of Babel'. 'The Doctor of Rhodes Island'."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Many have believed in you. Believed that you always make the right decision. That no matter how despairing the circumstances, you would always be able to find a way out."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"But—"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You are far from omnipotent."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"50_g9_airshipdeck","screenadapt":"coverall","block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_erthshkng","volume":1,"loop":true,"channel":"e"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":-1,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"It all happens in a flash of lightning."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Theresa does not reappear, having gathered up the shadows and taken them with her."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"As you approach the Cunabula of Suffering, the crystallization advances ever more rapidly."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Now that the tides of shadow have retreated, you finally notice that the crystals have covered the entirety of the airship."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_1035_wisdel_1#9$2","duration":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_4133_logos_1#12$1","duration":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#5$1","duration":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#7$1","duration":0.3}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Your companions still stand by your side. They are great fighters all, but in the face of this fated disaster, you are all powerless."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The airship, unable to stop, rams into Amnannam—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopsound","a":{"channel":"e","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.7,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"And is brought to a standstill."},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{"slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_394_1#13$1","focus":"m"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"—!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_black","screenadapt":"coverall","block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The instant that the ship is about to touch Amnannam, the colossal vessel, once hurtling at full speed, is slowed to a crawl."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Time itself stagnates."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The great Originium tree rapidly grows new limbs, firmly grasping the airship."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"The lush branches quickly extend and envelop the ship."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You see everyone trapped in that moment."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You see the Originium grow wildly."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You see Amiya anxiously stretch her hand out towards you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"50_i15","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"imagetween","a":{"xfrom":-60,"yfrom":-30,"xto":0,"yto":0,"xscalefrom":1.1,"yscalefrom":1.1,"xscaleto":1,"yscaleto":1,"duration":30,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_stonegrowing","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act9d0d0/m_avg_dignified_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/act9d0d0/m_avg_dignified_loop","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"This was the moment that time stopped for her. You can even see her shouting your name."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"But pure Originium covers her body at a terrifying speed, and the words never manage to leave her mouth."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"It spreads."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You rush towards her, but you are nowhere near fast enough."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"It engulfs."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You see the Originium about to swallow up the final dregs of her body."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Amiya!"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You muster all your strength to extend your hand, trying to grab hold of hers... but you are too late."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"You are no longer able to take hold of her hand."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"A torrent of jumbled information rushes into your mind."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"It is like you are seeing a tranquil world, one completely turned into Originium."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Amiya... Kal'tsit... Logos... W..."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"All of Rhodes Island. All of Londinium. All of the battlefield. All of Terra."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["Amiya!"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"No, this is not what you wanted to see."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"How could you allow all this to happen?"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Stop. Stop!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["STOP!"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_avg_stkmyer","volume":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_black","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_white","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st1","text":"<color=#000000>You did it, Dr. {@nickname}.</color>","x":300,"y":350,"alignment":"center","size":28,"delay":0,"duration":2,"width":700}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"sticker","a":{"id":"st1","duration":2,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"charslot","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a